For $1\leq i, k\leq n-1$ and $(\nu, j)\in K^{n}$, we have
\begin{equation}
\Theta_{i}\Theta_{i+1}\Theta_{i}=\Theta_{i+1}\Theta_{i}\Theta_{i+1},~~~~~~\Theta_{i}\Theta_{k}=\Theta_{k}\Theta_{i}\text{ if } \vert i-k\vert> 1;\label{theta}
