{\big(\nu_{i}(x_{i}+x_{i+1}+2)\big)^{2}}\\
&=\frac{(x_{i}-x_{i+1})\cdot(x_{i+1}-x_{i})}{(x_{i}+x_{i+1}+2)^{2}}.
